{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_texas_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_texas_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "使命必达",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_texas_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2f7b758c783b0e48a1a233985ff1080c394290fafa868aa804ebfb97be1d2b98",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "龙门  企鹅物流据点"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唉，唉唉唉这不对啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你输了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "不玩了，每次都是你赢，没意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我们还是看会儿电影吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "要什么零食？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "老样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "好叻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "喏，你最爱的饼干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯......这个爆炸场面不够啊，还没我在学校里搞的有味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "虽然这个主演的乌萨斯看上去有点眼熟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯？你以前也炸过东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唉，以前完全没听你提过啊，说来听听？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "没什么好说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "分享一下嘛，我又不会告诉别人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "是炸了校舍，还是礼堂，还是其他什么的？嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......我想应该是一座塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯，塔，斜塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "算是......当地地标建筑一样的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那你一定吃处分了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我只是为了家族工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "不像你，能背着处分还炸十几次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "啊这个嘛——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "学校就是让人开心的地方，当然要挑最有意思的东西玩啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "而且我也不是真的想炸坏什么东西，只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "只是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "只是想恶作剧的时候总是会出点小意外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "就拿莫斯提马那次举个例子吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "原本只是想吓唬她一下来着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "莫斯提马？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯啊，那个时候她还是我学姐，又是学校里的优等生，经常上台发言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "所以我在她上讲台的路上放了个小弹簧装置，结果，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "莫斯提马弹出去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "怎么会，她轻轻一跳就过去啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "后面跟着一起上台的学姐踩上然后飞出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "这和爆炸没关系吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "有啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你大概不知道，拉特兰这种场合都要荷枪实弹以示尊重的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "恰好那位学姐带的是，呃，重武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "也不知道是经验还是条件反射什么的，她很熟练地开枪射击用反作用力让自己平安落地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "然后她打出去的那发爆炸弹正好炸断了承重柱，礼堂就塌了一角......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你真的只是想要恶作剧吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "真的！我不是故意的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "哈......你要是敢在叙拉古这么做，第二天就会物理性死亡知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "掉脑袋都算好的，没什么痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "要是你真让别人在公开场合出丑，可就没那么简单了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "大概会被人断手断脚塞嘴里沉河底——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "噫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——完了还会把你捞起来挂在路口震慑其他有你这样危险想法的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "都是假的，对吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "别吓唬我啊......这些事都是以前上课的时候不懂事才干的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "现在我可是认真工作努力干活的普通人，不会给别人添麻烦的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "只是有时候，偶尔，嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "还挺想搞点小东西捉弄一下老板，你觉得怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "以你的破坏力，我建议你还是不——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "啊......老——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "哈呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "谁啊突然打我脑——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唉，老板你回来啦。今天怎么那么早呀，啊哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "没事就不能逮你们了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "哪有，只是恰好还没来活，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "那现在就变一个给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "啊哈，找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "赶紧把这个货送过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "这是地址和收货人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "好的，我知道了，现在就出发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "德克萨斯，你和她一起去，这是臭老鼠的货，麻烦得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "送完快点回来，那些家伙赔偿我的黑胶快到了，你们要帮我搬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "放心交给我们吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "啧，这时间路怎么堵成这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "不应该啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "难道说，又是哪位快递从业人员上公路飙车撞了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唉，德克萨斯，你从刚刚开始就在那发呆，想什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "德克萨斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（从地址上判断，这件货是给上次那些叙拉古黑帮的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（可他们不已经是鼠王的人了吗？为什么要通过我们来递送货物？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "德——克——萨——斯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯？！怎么，有敌人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "这里只有车，哪来的敌人哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "德克萨斯，这批货是不是给前几个月被我们打得满大街乱跑的黑衣人的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你怎么知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我们做物流的不就是会顺带多打听些消息嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我在那片地区送货的时候，收货人很多都是鲁珀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "而且那里的好多住户家中都有一套黑帽黑风衣挂在衣架上，辨识度特高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "除了他们，龙门也不会有别人这么穿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "哎哎，德克萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "说到黑帮，我突然好奇起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你以前在叙拉古也是那么穿的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "黑礼服白衬衫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "不，我是白礼服红衬衫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唔......感觉还挺配的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "也就是说，你和别人穿得不一样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "还蛮特立独行的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "各个家族的主要人物为了彰显自己的实力和地位，在服装上与其他鲁珀做出区分时常是一种必要的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那不是很显眼嘛，黑乎乎一片里出个不一样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "真的不会有人远远一枪——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "砰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "把你干掉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "黑帮的首领大多都很注重安保，适合狙击的位置都会安排自己家族的人预先值守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "如果真有这种情况发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我会把箭砍断——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "然后让那个人的家族从叙拉古除名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "以前的我会这样做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "现在......应该无所谓了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "怎么处理对头，那是老板需要头疼的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我们只要把货物送到指定地点，偶尔打几场架，就足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "有，有道理，嗯，你说的没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "这都堵了多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "半个小时？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "再这么堵下去也不是个办法啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你看，隔壁的司机都开始骂人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（狂摁喇叭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（摇下车窗）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，前面的*龙门粗口*，你到底开不开啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠闲的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要急嘛朋友，我也堵着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠闲的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你看看周围，大家都和你一起呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你*龙门粗口*的，我今天生意要是谈砸了，你必*龙门粗口*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠闲的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也急着去看老婆嘛，但车堵成这样，大家都没有办法的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠闲的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是觉得堵车无聊，过来和我打副牌怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠闲的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "听听广播也可以，最近的新闻都还挺有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你@！#~@%"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（把广播调至交通频道）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交通广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "据悉，两辆轿车在环城公路上发生碰撞，当龙门近卫局警官到场时，两辆车的车主皆已离开现场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交通广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "警官正在向目击者征求车主容貌特征并移开车辆，相信环城路段很快就能恢复畅通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交通广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "接下来是另一则交通信息——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "这种行事风格听起来有点熟。你觉得呢，德克萨斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "要不要给同事问个好呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（调整无线电频道）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "喂，喂，听得到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂喂，怎么了德克萨斯姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "可颂，怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "（弓弩乱飞的声音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有人要抢货啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "车坏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "坏了吧，不过修一修应该还有救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们可别和老板说啊，不然我这个月奖金又要没了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "不打扰你工作了，晚上见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我还以为只有我会做这种事呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你好像还很得意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唉疼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "再这么堵下去，回头老板会不高兴的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "能天使，我先带着货物过去，你在公路疏通之后赶紧过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "送货还是我去比较好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你知道和黑帮见面该说什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "不就是，企鹅物流送货上门——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "要是按照这个路数，场面很快就会和那一晚一样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "不就是打架嘛，我怎么会怕他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "这样真的好吗，他们这回可是收货人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "如果你就准备打完以后让他们签收货物的话，我也没什么好说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "啊......也是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "所以还是由我去比较好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "至少他们对“德克萨斯”这个名字的忌惮能避免很多冲突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "给，这是钥匙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "钥匙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "让我开车吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "暂时的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "回去还是我开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "好叻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "别把车撞了，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我办事你就放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我就是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "一会见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？德克萨斯怎么把剑落车上了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "龙门闹市"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（走这条道应该能再节省一点时间。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（姜齐街马上就到。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（8号，看上去是个大仓库，是这里没错。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（希望能送了东西就走......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "龙门闹市  姜齐街8号"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "德克萨斯？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "停，停下，不许再往前了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "（弩箭都换了橡皮头，看来他们真的开始守规矩了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我是来送快递的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "把东西放下，我们会派人接收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我需要把货亲自送到收货人手上，由他确认货物并签字才能离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）喂，怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）先问问这是给谁的货。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们会帮你把收货人叫出来，给我他的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "恩里科。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老大？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦——咳，咳嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你在这等着，我去请恩里科先生出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）撑住啊，我马上回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "德，德克萨斯，女士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您没有携带武器吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您不会从袖口里掏出一个源石剑柄然后把我们全杀了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就像孔特家族覆灭时那样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你知道规矩，龙门的规矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是这样，您说得对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（呼，还好......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "恩里科先生，这边请。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我是恩里科，德克萨斯女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "听说你有货物要给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "是的，一份快递。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "从鼠王那里来，请你尽快签收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "鼠王？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我明白了，请把快件给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "（打开快递盒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "嗯，的确是鼠王给我的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "需要我在哪里签名？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "这里，右下角的签名栏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "嗯——好，完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "那么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "请留步，德克萨斯女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "这个称呼应该留给叙拉古的家族首领，而不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "请叫我德克萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "好，好，德克萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你看，我和我的兄弟们来到龙门许多年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "前段时间，因为卡彭和甘比诺挑战了......这座城市的权威，所以他们被迫离开，而我，被大家推举出来领导家族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我想，寻求一下你的建议，如果方便的话，我们可以到里面详谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "不了，我给不出什么好建议，顶多就说几句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我洗耳恭听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你和你的兄弟，还会回到叙拉古去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "呵，我们应该会在龙门一直待下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "毕竟回去除了被西西里女士的仆从追杀外，什么好处都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "那么就不要太过坚持叙拉古的生活方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "像个龙门人一样生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "家族间的争斗放在这里是否行得通，我想你们应该清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "无论是从东国、乌萨斯还是叙拉古来到这里，要想长久生活下去，只有一个办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "成为龙门人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你们不是第一个来的，也不会是最后一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "帮派的人来来去去，最后留下的，只有龙门人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我想说的，就这么多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "再会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "德克萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你也已经成为龙门人了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "或许是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "但我终归会回去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咔嗒\n哔——哔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......这是什么声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "好像是从这个箱子里传来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "哟，搞定啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我以为车开过来的时候你已经在等我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "稍微聊了几句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你还会主动和人聊天啊，挺稀奇的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "只是让他们以后别给老板添麻烦，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "是这样？看来他们也能好好交流嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "可是，哎，你回头看看，那些现在正在往外冲的人是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "他们确实是追着你出来的吧？好像不是很友好诶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......出了一点小状况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我离开的时候远远听到了点声音，老板好像把货交给我们前，做了点......改动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那现在怎么说，打吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "打？快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "这街区全是黑帮，你想再用工资赔老板一辆车吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "对哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "把钥匙给我，走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "哈啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "欧厄尔那家伙看上去五大三粗的，藏酒倒还有点水平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "等拿完唱片再去他那里多搬几箱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "你们两个再不回来黑胶都要自己飞到我怀里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "货不是鼠王给黑帮的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "是臭老鼠的货，只是我做了点改装。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "那帮黑漆漆的家伙以为炸了我的黑胶就能拍拍屁股走人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "想都别想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "告诉我，德克萨斯，他们有没有被倒数结束后播放的rap气得抓狂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "没有？怎么可能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "那可是我为这帮小丑特别准备的rap，录之前当街找了个鲁珀试效果，他当场就气晕过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "他们没有气晕，听了几句rap以后很干脆地冲出来打我和能天使了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我们两个开车在龙门绕了半天才甩开黑帮的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "那肯定是你的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "我可是精确估算了你送货交接的平均时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "为了保护员工的人身安全，我录音的时候就已经在前几分钟留了空白，还在延时播放按钮上多点了两三下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "啊我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "那些个鲁珀又因为你的名字问东问西了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "正是考虑到了这一点，才显得我准备周全啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "他们绝对想不到，那是我为他们特别准备的热身运动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "在进行一番激烈的追逐后回去听到这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "一点气恼，加一些愤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "哦！只要一口气接不上来，谁都救不了他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "小魏只说不可以用实弹，没说我不能动嘴啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "啊哈哈哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "继续干活，跟我搬黑胶去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "是，老板......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
